[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8821.429, "timestamp": "02:27:01", "text": "但最近人们却说：“不，不是这样。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8823.429, "timestamp": "02:27:03", "text": "那就是阿门。她不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8825.51, "timestamp": "02:27:05", "text": "嫁给任何人。”是啊，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8827.99, "timestamp": "02:27:07", "text": "作者也证实了这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8830.15, "timestamp": "02:27:10", "text": "真奇怪，有些粉丝竟然喜欢重温旧剧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8832.23, "timestamp": "02:27:12", "text": "一遍又一遍地重复，并发现更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8836.15, "timestamp": "02:27:16", "text": "每天都有引用。确切地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8838.389, "timestamp": "02:27:18", "text": "恋人，这意味着她纯洁地死去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8840.15, "timestamp": "02:27:20", "text": "日本文化。意思是，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8843.11, "timestamp": "02:27:23", "text": "确切地。 M 和我都觉得它很漂亮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8845.83, "timestamp": "02:27:25", "text": "这一切真的太酷了，就像……想象一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8847.11, "timestamp": "02:27:27", "text": "只是想说，所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8849.75, "timestamp": "02:27:29", "text": "事情是米克塔萨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8851.67, "timestamp": "02:27:31", "text": "呃，你知道这一切是如何发生的，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8854.389, "timestamp": "02:27:34", "text": "然后你们注意到了吗？哦，是的，你们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8856.63, "timestamp": "02:27:36", "text": "继续。对不起。不不不，那是那样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8858.87, "timestamp": "02:27:38", "text": "我只想说这些。他其实就是你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8860.79, "timestamp": "02:27:40", "text": "伙计们注意到，就像在赛季期间一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8862.63, "timestamp": "02:27:42", "text": "艾琳的眼睛颜色在发生变化，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8865.67, "timestamp": "02:27:45", "text": "阿门渐渐忘记了自己的眼睛颜色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8867.67, "timestamp": "02:27:47", "text": "正在讲述这个故事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8869.91, "timestamp": "02:27:49", "text": "我以前从没注意到这一点。这就是艾琳的原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8872.309, "timestamp": "02:27:52", "text": "每个季节都有不同的眼睛颜色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8873.91, "timestamp": "02:27:53", "text": "所以它一开始是棕色的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8877.59, "timestamp": "02:27:57", "text": "最后还是绿色的。是的。正确的。哦，我的天"}]